WEBVTT

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:03.831
Well, I for one, I'm pretty
excited about this future,

00:09:03.872 --> 00:09:05.583
a future where greater data sharing

00:09:05.583 --> 00:09:08.669
can really help us
jointly combat climate change.

00:09:08.669 --> 00:09:13.591
What we need is for company leaders
to move away from FOMA

00:09:13.632 --> 00:09:16.010
and back to good old-fashioned FOMO.

00:09:16.468 --> 00:09:19.388
The future is bright
if all that data can be shared,

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.557
and I don't think
we really want to miss out.

00:09:21.599 --> 00:09:22.766
Thank you.

00:09:22.766 --> 00:09:25.436
(Applause)